      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "ZoeW",
        "name": "Spell Thief",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Zoe can pick up the remnants of enemy summoner spell and active item casts and cast them once herself. Whenever she casts a summoner spell, she gains 3 missiles that fire at the nearest target.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Enemies drop spell shards when casting a Summoner Spell or using an Active Item. Specific minions also drop a spell shard when Zoe or a nearby ally kills them. Zoe can pick up this shard to cast that ability once.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> When Zoe casts this Ability or any Summoner Spell, she gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">30/40/50/60/70% Move Speed</span> for 2/2.25/2.5/2.75/3 seconds and tosses 3 missiles at the target she Attacked most recently. These missiles deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15/25/35/45/55 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> each.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Cast the Ability from a spell shard Zoe has picked up.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Spell shards last on the ground for 40 seconds.<br />Each missile can apply <span>More Sparkles!</span></span>",
        "iconFile": "ZoeW.png",
