      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "ZoeE",
        "name": "Sleepy Trouble Bubble",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Causes the target to become drowsy, then fall asleep. While asleep, the target's Magic Resist is reduced. The first source of damage that breaks the sleep is doubled, up to a cap.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zoe dropkicks a bubble that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + (45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, lingering as a trap if it hits nothing. The bubble's range is extended when flying over terrain.<br /><br />If either the bubble or trap hits an enemy champion she refreshes 16/19.5/23/26.5/30% of her cooldown.<br /><br />After a delay, the victim falls <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Asleep</span> and have their <span>Magic Resist</span> reduced by 30% for 2 seconds. Attacks and Ability hits wake them up but deal double damage, up to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + (45% Ability Power)) true damage</span>.<br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Before the target falls <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Asleep</span>, they are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Drowsy</span>, becoming increasingly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> (up to 10/15/20/25/30%).</span>",
